Presence of this file opts the project into the protoblast plugin's checkIconNames and
checkIconNameTemplates compile gates (every literal icon name must be one plumage's
IconRegistry bundles -- an unbundled name renders the missing-icon placeholder and nothing
else ever objects; see CheckIconNamesTask).

Opted in 2026-08-14, after a UX walkthrough found 57 distinct unbundled names in this repo
rendering as empty squares across the sidebar, the dashboard tiles and the record tabs. The
guard is the reason that cannot recur silently; it is NOT retroactive proof, so a name it
cannot see (a token-position literal, a name built through a constant, a dynamic argument)
still has to be checked by eye.
